English Summary
------------------------------------------------------------------------

1. Client Application (Freeware, All Rights Reserved):
   Free for personal, non-commercial desktop use, fan showcase videos, and casual streaming. Reverse engineering, unpacking/modifying `app.asar`, removing attribution, or any form of commercial resale / paid redistribution is strictly prohibited.

2. Pet Packs & Duo Packs (`.petpack` / `.duopack`):
   Shared free of charge under CC BY-NC-ND 4.0 principles with additional anti-extraction terms. Commercial sale, paid gating, unpacking raw media/textures (`.webm` / `.bc7z`), redistributing modified packs, or using extracted assets for dataset/model training is strictly prohibited. Local dialogue edits for strictly personal use are permitted.

3. Fanwork & Third-Party IP Notice:
   Characters from third-party franchises (such as *BanG Dream!*) remain the sole property of their respective copyright holders (e.g., Bushiroad Inc. / BanG Dream! Project). Fan-made packs are non-profit derivative works distributed completely free for personal enjoyment. Provided "AS IS" without warranty of any kind.
